"esc esc      rewind to an earlier turn             shift+tab    cycle permission mode               "
"ctrl+c       interrupt · clear input · twice to …  1-9 · y/a/n  answer the open dialog              "
"ctrl+d       exit on an empty input                ctrl+e       expand the dialog's preview         "
